        "summary": "Play as Alex and Ryan and cross River City to fight street gangs and save your girlfriend from the hands of a bad guy named \"Slick.\" Improve your fighting experience by powering-up your characters in River City's shops, picking-up items for bonuses and using the trash bins and pipes you will find in its streets.",
