      {
        "id": 7580,
        "name": "Baseball",
        "summary": "The simply titled game \"Baseball\" was developed by Nintendo in 1983 for the Nintendo Family Computer, and was one of the very first games released for the Famicon. It was also included as one of the 18 games released for the Nintendo Entertainment System's original launch in the United States.",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_small/co42pg.jpg",
