        "name": "MiG-29 Soviet Fighter",
        "summary": "MiG-29: Soviet Fighter is a shoot 'em up game developed by Codemasters in 1989 and released for several contemporary home computers. An unlicensed version was also released for the Nintendo Entertainment System by Camerica.",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_small/co3k5f.jpg",
