        "summary": "They're coming to your town! Isolated Warrior is a high-speed, uniquely developed game based on a 3-D concept that features over 40 types of enemy creatures, realistic graphics and explosive sound effects! Become Max Maverick, a lone warrior, who must defeat the awesome creatures that attack his highly civilized planet!",
