        "name": "High Speed",
        "summary": "The hottest pinball game ever has been converted to video! All the action and excitement of the original HIGH SPEED is here - Freeway Frenzy, Ramp Race and Running the Red - plus excellent new features like Lightning Bombs and attacking enemies! It's a real-life adventure. The screen flashes and a siren shrieks when you run the red light! Police car radio messages and original chase music both add to the thrills. Go for the burn - grab the jackpot and get away at HIGH SPEED!",
