        "summary": "No, this isn’t your typical block stacker. This is better. This is Dúshlán*. Dúshlán flips Tetris on its blocky head with new twists on a fundamental classic.\n\nNEW FEATURES AND CHALLENGES\n- Brand New, All Original Shapes\n- Upside Down Levels\n- Rising Floors\n- Block Save and Swap System\n- Horizontal Attacks\n\nBrought to the NES in collaboration with the ever-talented Peter McQuillan.",
