        "id": 141912,
        "name": "Proto Dere .Nes",
        "summary": "The creation of the ancient Proto Dere .Nes led to AppSir's modern day hits Dere .Exe and Dere Evil .Exe. For 33 years, the cartridge could not be found.\n\nWhile not as big as AppSir's modern titles, it was an important artifact that was sought after for decades.",
