        "id": 274984,
        "name": "Metroid Confrontation 2: Return to SR388",
        "summary": "Metroid Confrontation 2: Return to SR388 is a NES Metroid hack, based on Gameboy’s Metroid 2 and a little bit inspired by AM2R. Made using the Editroid program (created by Snarfblam).\n\nA lot of things has ben modified: All graphics (backgrounds and sprites), all map, text and music; to look like Metroid 2. Unarmored samus sprites were based on rogue dawn hack.",
