        "name": "Chip's Challenge",
        "summary": "The cancelled NES port of Chip's Challenge, originally for the Atari Lynx. A build, labeled as \"V0.924B\" on the title screen, was released by Lost Levels on November 13, 2015.\n\nThe normal level sequence contains only 132 levels (one exclusive to the NES port), plus 4 secret levels. That leaves 13 levels from the original game inaccessible.\n\nEntering the password HARD takes the player to Forced Entry, from which they can access the other removed levels: Blobnet, Mishmesh, Scavenger Hunt, On the Rocks, Slo Mo, Cityblock, Colony, Icehouse, Block N Roll, Blobdance, Pain, and Yorkhouse.",
